    "description": "## Problem\n\nFraud flagging is only available for In Progress and Completed Sign-Ups. Emily + Lina confirmed New-status records must also be flaggable.\n\n## Current state\n\nFlag_Sign_Up screen flow (reason code + notes) is exposed only at In Progress/Completed. New records have no flag entry point.\n\n## Proposed solution\n\n1. Expose the Flag action (button + Flag_Sign_Up flow) on New-status Sign-Ups.\n2. Reuse the existing reason-code + notes modal and Fraud_Review_Status__c lifecycle — no new flow.\n\n## Acceptance criteria (draft — item 3 blocked pending answers below)\n\n1. Positive — a New Sign-Up can be flagged with reason code + notes, identical modal to In Progress.\n2. Negative — flagging does not advance the record to In Progress.\n3. BLOCKED: post-flag status behaviour, list-view visibility, ops review path.\n\n## Blocked on (client-facing question list)\n\n1. Once a New Sign-Up is flagged — does it stay New, or move to Archived?\n2. Should flagged New Sign-Ups hide from rep list views?\n3. Do they enter the same ops fraud-review workflow as In Progress/Completed/Archived flags?\n\n## Source\n\nEmily doc comment, resolved thread 2026-08-28: Lina confirmed status New should have the ability to be marked as fraud. [Feedback doc](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1LOMrG0-0JchyP9wHrV4hMlBqh-gMq8YxknpySd5OJjY/edit)",
