          "id": "10386",
          "body": "Questions answered in 09/01 sync—\n\n**Q1 — Status of a flagged New sign-up. New scope added.**\n\n* Fraud confirmed, no payment sent → move status from New to Archived.\n* Fraud confirmed, payment sent → do not change status. Set a new \"Write-off\" checkbox instead.\n* Fraud dismissed → return the record to its prior status. Remove the flag only.\n* New scope: add a \"Write-off\" checkbox. Confirm if a \"Payment Sent\" field exists. Add logic to set Write-off = true when fraud is confirmed and Payment Sent = true.\n\n**Q2 — Hide flagged New sign-ups from rep list views.** \n\n* Archived records already drop off rep list views. This covers confirmed-fraud records.\n\n**Q3 — Same fraud-review workflow as later-stage flags. RESOLVED.**\n\n* Yes. New-status flags follow the same suspected → confirmed/dismissed path as other statuses.\n\n",
          "created": "2026-09-03T09:34:28.791-0400",
          "updated": "2026-09-03T09:34:28.791-0400",
          "jsdPublic": true
        }
